---
Delete every lobo pod on every provider

Usage:
  lobo down [OPTIONS]

Flags:
      --json[=<JSON>]  print {"spent_usd": …} on stdout
  -h, --help           help for down

Global Flags:
      --config <string>  config file (dotenv; the OS env is never read) [default: /home/u/.config/lobo/config.env]
